{"html_text": {"ja442:0.1": "<article id='ja442'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja442:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja442:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja442:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja442:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:2.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja442:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja442:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja442:11.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja442:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja442:0.2": "Dasakanipāta ", "ja442:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja442:0.4": "4. Saṅkhajātaka ", "ja442:1.1": "“Bahussuto sutadhammosi saṅkha, ", "ja442:1.2": "Diṭṭhā tayā samaṇabrāhmaṇā ca; ", "ja442:1.3": "Athakkhaṇe dassayase vilāpaṁ, ", "ja442:1.4": "Añño nu ko te paṭimantako mayā”. ", "ja442:2.1": "“Subbhū subhā suppaṭimukkakambu, ", "ja442:2.2": "Paggayha sovaṇṇamayāya pātiyā; ", "ja442:2.3": "‘Bhuñjassu bhattaṁ’ iti maṁ vadeti, ", "ja442:2.4": "Saddhāvittā ", "ja442:2.5": "Tamahaṁ noti brūmi”. ", "ja442:3.1": "“Etādisaṁ brāhmaṇa disvāna yakkhaṁ, ", "ja442:3.2": "Puccheyya poso sukhamāsisāno; ", "ja442:3.3": "Uṭṭhehi naṁ pañjalikābhipuccha, ", "ja442:3.4": "Devī nusi tvaṁ uda mānusī nu”. ", "ja442:4.1": "“Yaṁ tvaṁ sukhenābhisamekkhase maṁ, ", "ja442:4.2": "Bhuñjassu bhattaṁ iti maṁ vadesi; ", "ja442:4.3": "Pucchāmi taṁ nāri mahānubhāve, ", "ja442:4.4": "Devī nusi tvaṁ uda mānusī nu”. ", "ja442:5.1": "“Devī ahaṁ saṅkha mahānubhāvā, ", "ja442:5.2": "Idhāgatā sāgaravārimajjhe; ", "ja442:5.3": "Anukampikā no ca paduṭṭhacittā, ", "ja442:5.4": "Taveva atthāya idhāgatāsmi. ", "ja442:6.1": "Idhannapānaṁ sayanāsanañca, ", "ja442:6.2": "Yānāni nānāvividhāni saṅkha; ", "ja442:6.3": "Sabbassa tyāhaṁ paṭipādayāmi, ", "ja442:6.4": "Yaṁ kiñci tuyhaṁ manasābhipatthitaṁ”. ", "ja442:7.1": "“Yaṁ kiñci yiṭṭhañca hutañca mayhaṁ, ", "ja442:7.2": "Sabbassa no issarā tvaṁ sugatte; ", "ja442:7.3": "Susoṇi subbhamu suvilaggamajjhe, ", "ja442:7.4": "Kissa me kammassa ayaṁ vipāko”. ", "ja442:8.1": "“Ghamme pathe brāhmaṇa ekabhikkhuṁ, ", "ja442:8.2": "Ugghaṭṭapādaṁ tasitaṁ kilantaṁ; ", "ja442:8.3": "Paṭipādayī saṅkha upāhanāni, ", "ja442:8.4": "Sā dakkhiṇā kāmaduhā tavajja”. ", "ja442:9.1": "“Sā hotu nāvā phalakūpapannā, ", "ja442:9.2": "Anavassutā erakavātayuttā; ", "ja442:9.3": "Aññassa yānassa na hettha bhūmi, ", "ja442:9.4": "Ajjeva maṁ moḷiniṁ pāpayassu”. ", "ja442:10.1": "“Sā tattha vittā sumanā patītā, ", "ja442:10.2": "Nāvaṁ sucittaṁ abhinimminitvā; ", "ja442:10.3": "Ādāya saṅkhaṁ purisena saddhiṁ, ", "ja442:10.4": "Upānayī nagaraṁ sādhuramman”ti. ", "ja442:11.1": "Saṅkhajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja442:0.1": "", "ja442:0.2": "", "ja442:0.3": "", "ja442:0.4": "", "ja442:1.1": "", "ja442:1.2": "", "ja442:1.3": "", "ja442:1.4": "", "ja442:2.1": "Subbhū → subbhā (sya1ed, sya2ed); subbhu (pts-vp-pli1); subhmā (mr) ", "ja442:2.2": "", "ja442:2.3": "", "ja442:2.4": "Saddhāvittā → saddhācittā (bj, pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja442:2.5": "", "ja442:3.1": "disvāna → disva (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja442:3.2": "sukhamāsisāno → sukhamāsasāno (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); sukhamāsisamāno (mr) ", "ja442:3.3": "", "ja442:3.4": "", "ja442:4.1": "", "ja442:4.2": "", "ja442:4.3": "", "ja442:4.4": "", "ja442:5.1": "", "ja442:5.2": "", "ja442:5.3": "", "ja442:5.4": "", "ja442:6.1": "", "ja442:6.2": "", "ja442:6.3": "", "ja442:6.4": "", "ja442:7.1": "yiṭṭhañca hutañca → yiṭṭhaṁva hutaṁva (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja442:7.2": "", "ja442:7.3": "subbhamu → subbhu (bj); subbhā (sya1ed, sya2ed); subbhuru (pts-vp-pli1) | suvilaggamajjhe → suvilākamajjhe (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); vilākamajjhe (pts-vp-pli1); suvilātamajjhe (mr) ", "ja442:7.4": "", "ja442:8.1": "", "ja442:8.2": "", "ja442:8.3": "upāhanāni → upāhanāhi (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja442:8.4": "", "ja442:9.1": "", "ja442:9.2": "", "ja442:9.3": "na hettha → na hatthi (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja442:9.4": "", "ja442:10.1": "", "ja442:10.2": "", "ja442:10.3": "", "ja442:10.4": "", "ja442:11.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja442:0.1